# ============================================================================
# POLARIS - frontend configuration
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed VITE_ to the browser bundle, and
# EVERYTHING here is publicly readable once the site is built.
#
# ==> NEVER put a database URL, password, private API key or secret here. <==
#
# POLARIS needs none: the browser talks only to the POLARIS API, and the API
# holds all credentials server-side.
# ============================================================================

# Base URL of the POLARIS API.
#
# LOCAL DEV  leave unset. vite.config.js proxies /api to 127.0.0.1:8000, so
#            the default relative "/api" just works.
#
# PRODUCTION set this to the deployed backend, including /api:
#            VITE_API_URL=https://polaris-api.onrender.com/api
#
# VITE_API_URL=
